  "claim": "An actor played the role of \"Annabelle\" in the film The Fruit Machine . This actor is known for his film roles as a fictional character based on a book series written by John Cleese.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Robbie Coltrane. Sentence: Robbie Coltrane, OBE (born Anthony Robert McMillan; 30 March 1950) is a Scottish actor and author.\nPage: Robbie Coltrane. Sentence: He is known for his roles as Rubeus Hagrid in the \"Harry Potter\" films, as Valentin Dmitrovich Zukovsky in the James Bond films \"GoldenEye\" and \"The World Is Not Enough,\" and as Dr. Eddie \"Fitz\" Fitzgerald in the British TV series \"Cracker\" during the 1990s.\nPage: Rubeus Hagrid. Sentence: Rubeus Hagrid is a fictional character in the \"Harry Potter\" book series written by J. K. Rowling.\nPage: The Fruit Machine. Sentence: The Fruit Machine (known as Wonderland in the United States) is a 1988 British film thriller starring Tony Forsyth, Emile Charles, Bruce Payne and Robbie Coltrane in the role of \"Annabelle\".",
